<title>USA: Bergenfield, N.J., defeats $2.6 mln bond question.</title>
<headline>Bergenfield, N.J., defeats $2.6 mln bond question.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bergenfield, N.J., voters Tuesday rejected a $2.6 million school bond referendum by a vote of 1,574 to 967, a Board of Education official said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The bond proceeds would have been used to finance school upgrades and renovations.</p>
<p>--Steven Dickson, 212-859-1652</p>
